  "description": "UPHILL. DOWNHILL. WHY NOT BOTH? The name KAPOHO is often spoken of as one of the world’s most popular e-bike full-suspension models - and right, because the range of applications is limitless. Whether you’re tackling steep climbs or thrilling descents, it pushes the limits of what’s possible. At the same time, its trail suspension comfort makes it perfect for leisurely bike tours as well. With 160mm of travel, KAPOHO represents the ideal allrounder in the collection. All models are fitted with the proven DiMMiX (Dimension-Mix) tires: 29-inch wheel at the front for optimal riding stability paired with the 27.5-inch PLUS tires at the rear for best power transmission and traction, shows all its advantages in difficult terrain. Thanks to the STRAIGHT-LINE-LINK (SLL) concept for a sensitive and direct suspension performance, the KAPOHO bikes are ready for any outdoor adventure. The Performance Line CX (BDU384Y) takes riding dynamics and agility to a whole new level. It is powerful, light and quiet (120 Nm max. torque, 750-Watt max. motor power, 600% max. support factor). The Power Tube battery provides 800 Wh. POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) is KTM’s innovation for user-friendly battery handling. Removing and reinserting the battery becomes a breeze.",
